<title>MOZAMBIQUE: PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - March 10.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - March 10.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Mozambican press on Monday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>NOTICIAS</p>
<p>- Sixteen United Nations officials are under investigation in New York over financial irregularities in nine countries -- one of which is Mozambique.</p>
<p>- Mozambique's Ferroviario soccer team beat Madagascar 4-0 in an African Champions Cup match in Maputo on Sunday.</p>
</text>
